OL,3,GNEWSAForce rated 'inadequate' at
OL,4,Acracking crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report has labelled Bedfordshire
OL,7,FPolice "inadequate" when it comes to
OL,8,Finvestigating crime.
OL,10,FInspectors said the force had
OL,11,F"deteriorated" in that area, which was
OL,12,F"a significant concern".
OL,14,FHM Inspectorate of Constabulary and
OL,15,FFire & Rescue Services also found
OL,16,Fproblems with leadership, crime
OL,17,Fdeterrence and managing fraud.
OL,19,FBedfordshire Police said it accepted
OL,20,Fthe report's findings.
